# Project Safety Rules

This project is a greenfield rebuild with `old-system/` as read-only reference.

All AI tools must follow the same project rules.

## Absolute rules

- Do not modify `main` or `dev` directly.
- Do not modify, format, delete, or add code under `old-system/`.
- Do not copy old-system code into the new system.
- Do not expose or commit secrets.
- Do not change the fixed tech stack without approval.
- Do not introduce a second backend task system.
- Do not generate multiple modules or pages in one task.
- Do not refactor unrelated files.

Before editing, read `AGENTS.md` and the related docs.
